asap rocky has been released from jail  the rapper real name rakim meyers was  arrested wednesday morning in connection  with a 2021 los angeles shooting rocky  was arrested at lax upon his return from  barbados where he was vacationing with  girlfriend rihanna who is pregnant with  their first child the 33 year old  musician was interviewed at the lapd  robbery homicide division before being  booked at the metropolitan detention  center rocky was released the same day  on a felony charge of assault with a  deadly weapon after posting 550 thousand  dollars bail  as for why he was arrested the lapd says  on november 6 2021 an argument between  two acquaintances occurred in the  hollywood area the authorities add the  argument escalated and resulted in the  suspect firing a handgun at the victim  the victim sustained a minor injury from  the incident and later sought medical  treatment following the shooting the  suspect and two additional males fled  the area on foot  shortly after rocky's arrest the lapd  executed a search warrant on his los  angeles home where a source tells et  that about six to seven lapd vehicles  were seen blocking traffic from entering  or exiting his residential street  no one other than police and a few  paparazzi were on the street during the  aftermath  so what's next a court date has been set  for august 17th the la district  attorney's office tells et that a case  has been presented and is under review  and since the news broke of his arrest  e.t has learned that rihanna is only  focused on one thing her pregnancy i'm  trying to enjoy it as much as i could  our source says this drama is the last  thing rihanna needs right now she wants  to be mellow relaxed and focused 100  percent on the arrival of her baby not  stressing out  rihanna made a point to navigate the  public side of her pregnancy on her own  terms and now suddenly things seem out  of her control e.t spoke with rocky in  february just one month after the couple  revealed they're starting a family  together what are you looking forward to  as you move into a new chapter of your  life i'm just excited for what i don't  know yet you know everything is new to  me so  you know i'm excited  [Music]
 

